<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen raises Biogen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen raises Biogen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen and Co said it raised its rating on Biogen Inc to strong buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a report analyst David Stone and Joyce Lonergan said they see Biogen's stock with upside potential to $95-$100 in 12 months.</p>
<p>-- The ongoing rollout of Biogen's multiple sclerosis drug Avonex should make Biogen a strong participant in a biotech rally that the Cowen analysts expect this fall, the report said.</p>
<p>-- Biogen's shares were up 1/8 at 67.</p>
</text>
